00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:05,759
Chapter 14. Nantucket.

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:09,919
Nothing more happened on the passage worthy of mentioning. So after a fine

3
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,958
run, we safely arrived in Nantucket.

4
00:00:12,959 --> 00:00:17,839
Nantucket. Take out your map and look at it. See what a real corner of the world

5
